WEBVTT

00:57.160 --> 00:57.960
Come here. Come here.

00:59.080 --> 01:00.240
What are you doing?

01:00.880 --> 01:02.360
You won't regret following me.

01:02.960 --> 01:04.519
In a few days,

01:04.519 --> 01:06.120
I, Moo-yeol,

01:06.520 --> 01:08.080
I'll make you a conferred wife.

01:08.080 --> 01:09.400
Who's with you?

01:09.400 --> 01:10.840
You forced me.

01:11.400 --> 01:12.400
So what?

01:13.400 --> 01:15.280
If I force you, you're mine too.

01:16.200 --> 01:18.160
From now on, you'll always be.

01:19.120 --> 01:21.560
Move aside. I'm going to the bridal chamber to serve.

01:46.960 --> 01:49.479
Aren't you going to buy the guests a drink?

01:49.479 --> 01:50.840
They are my subordinates.

01:51.360 --> 01:52.640
It doesn't matter if you're late.

01:53.520 --> 01:56.440
It's more exciting

01:57.039 --> 02:00.720
It makes my heart itch.

02:08.360 --> 02:10.120
A lesson makes you wise.

02:10.440 --> 02:13.360
I still remember

02:13.360 --> 02:15.120
what you did last time.

02:21.240 --> 02:22.320
General.

02:23.160 --> 02:24.400
Cross-cupped wine.

02:26.040 --> 02:27.120
General.

02:34.400 --> 02:36.440
General, Moo-yeol is here.

02:38.040 --> 02:40.079
Your wife is waiting for you.

02:40.720 --> 02:41.400
Come in.

02:42.960 --> 02:43.760
Yes, sir! Yes, sir!

02:50.320 --> 02:50.920
General.

02:52.480 --> 02:53.600
Say it.

02:53.600 --> 02:55.120
As you expected,

02:55.400 --> 02:58.200
Nine-head is the eldest son of the Helian Clan.

02:58.200 --> 02:59.200
He Lian Jin.

03:00.280 --> 03:02.320
Did you catch him and He Lian Cheng?

03:02.840 --> 03:03.920
Not yet.

03:04.000 --> 03:05.000
Idiot!

03:05.080 --> 03:06.040
Calm down, General.

03:06.720 --> 03:08.360
I gave you five thousand elites.

03:09.080 --> 03:11.280
You can't even catch those scumbags of the Helian Clan.

03:11.480 --> 03:14.920
Half of the 5,000 elites surrendered to He Lian Jin.

03:15.200 --> 03:17.800
Most of our garrisons in Colorless City turned against him.

03:18.079 --> 03:18.880
So...

03:19.640 --> 03:20.440
Bastard!

03:21.120 --> 03:23.720
You bastard!

03:23.800 --> 03:25.960
You ungrateful bastard!

03:26.240 --> 03:27.520
Pass my order.

03:28.040 --> 03:30.400
Attack Colorless City tomorrow.

03:30.800 --> 03:32.280
Before entering the capital,

03:33.040 --> 03:35.840
I will destroy Colorless City.

03:35.840 --> 03:36.400
Yes.

03:43.240 --> 03:45.400
There are 200,000 soldiers in the North.

03:45.720 --> 03:47.320
He Lian Jin.

03:49.800 --> 03:52.040
General. Madam.

03:52.040 --> 03:53.520
Please drink the couple wine.

03:53.520 --> 03:55.200
Let's drink together.

03:55.640 --> 03:57.320
Let's be united and grow old together.

04:07.600 --> 04:08.400
Hahaha.

04:14.880 --> 04:15.760
Baili Jinghong.

04:17.160 --> 04:17.959
You are despicable!

04:19.600 --> 04:21.040
Accept your fate, Your Highness.

04:21.279 --> 04:23.080
Even if your magic is extraordinary,

04:23.160 --> 04:24.960
you can’t resist

04:24.960 --> 04:26.440
you can’t resist it.

04:26.440 --> 04:27.240
Get out of here! Get out of here!

04:32.240 --> 04:33.159
Get lost!

04:46.280 --> 04:48.280
Your Highness, are you okay?

05:00.360 --> 05:01.160
Momo.

05:02.160 --> 05:03.680
You want to die?

05:10.600 --> 05:11.400
Momo.

05:15.600 --> 05:16.720
Your Highness, go!

05:19.480 --> 05:20.760
Let go of me.

05:22.200 --> 05:23.880
You'll die if you don't let go.

05:24.440 --> 05:25.960
Your Highness, go!

05:26.640 --> 05:27.960
Why?

05:28.720 --> 05:30.840
Don't you hate me?

05:31.640 --> 05:32.840
Ever since I met you,

05:34.159 --> 05:36.320
I only see your kindness

05:37.600 --> 05:39.040
and protection.

05:39.600 --> 05:41.080
How can I hate you?

05:41.800 --> 05:42.960
You are not a demon queen.

05:45.480 --> 05:46.400
You are not.

05:50.880 --> 05:51.960
Your Highness. Your Highness.

05:56.920 --> 05:58.400
Your Highness.

06:00.240 --> 06:01.040
Momo.

06:24.000 --> 06:24.800
Nine-head.

06:26.720 --> 06:27.640
No.

06:28.200 --> 06:29.640
I should call you He Lian Jin.

07:56.000 --> 07:57.800
Only I can detoxify your poison.

07:58.440 --> 08:00.720
You can't live even if I die.

08:05.160 --> 08:06.640
Why did you marry him?

08:07.520 --> 08:09.680
He can't force you because you have the Camp.

08:18.600 --> 08:20.200
You're poisoned.

08:27.200 --> 08:29.000
Because I don't want to wait anymore.

08:30.920 --> 08:32.200
I've been in the palace for five years.

08:34.320 --> 08:36.039
When I got the death certificate,

08:38.400 --> 08:39.880
Shen Lian asked me to endure it.

08:40.760 --> 08:42.440
I waited for her poison.

08:44.280 --> 08:46.000
I surrendered to the throne.

08:46.920 --> 08:49.240
I waited for Ji Hong Zhen's desire.

08:50.000 --> 08:52.960
I want to wait for you this time.

08:53.800 --> 08:56.200
but it’s Baili Jinghong’s wedding.

09:01.440 --> 09:02.240
He Lian Jin.

09:03.200 --> 09:05.160
You broke your promise.

09:09.160 --> 09:12.440
Since then, I told myself

09:14.480 --> 09:16.080
I won't wait for anyone.

09:16.840 --> 09:19.400
I won't accept any other arrangement.

09:21.240 --> 09:22.160
I want to seize power.

09:23.080 --> 09:24.520
I want to go back to the capital.

09:24.920 --> 09:26.720
I want to ascend the throne myself.

09:27.760 --> 09:29.640
I want to be the Supreme Lord.

09:30.360 --> 09:32.280
I want to be the best in the world.

09:34.200 --> 09:35.000
The throne?

09:35.920 --> 09:36.800
I'll get it for you.

10:07.520 --> 10:08.560
Go find the general.

10:08.760 --> 10:10.360
Someone rebelled at the wedding.

10:22.760 --> 10:23.560
Ji Mingyue.

10:24.280 --> 10:25.800
Do you know what you are doing?

10:26.560 --> 10:28.040
I know very well.

10:42.720 --> 10:44.520
Ji Mingyue.

10:45.120 --> 10:46.560
Look carefully.

10:46.560 --> 10:47.960
Do you know who I am?

11:07.760 --> 11:10.760
The thief in the palace. It's really you.

11:10.760 --> 11:12.560
Who else do you think it is?

13:00.640 --> 13:01.600
I'll give you

13:02.200 --> 13:03.160
whatever you want.

13:04.360 --> 13:05.160
The military power is the same.

13:06.400 --> 13:08.800
and the throne.

13:10.360 --> 13:11.360
What's the condition?

13:14.960 --> 13:16.120
I hope

13:16.120 --> 13:17.200
after you ascend the throne,

13:17.800 --> 13:18.680
you will be released

13:19.560 --> 13:21.920
Release the Helian Clan.

13:21.920 --> 13:24.880
Let them be free and never be slaves.

13:27.440 --> 13:29.960
What if I say no?

13:36.080 --> 13:36.880
I'm just kidding.

13:39.240 --> 13:41.520
I promise you, He Lian Jin.

13:42.640 --> 13:45.200
If I ascend the throne,

13:46.480 --> 13:48.360
I will release the Helian family

13:49.360 --> 13:50.840
and never be slaves.

13:53.480 --> 13:54.280
The moon is the witness.

13:58.000 --> 13:58.800
The moon is my witness.

14:15.040 --> 14:16.440
I came back too late.

14:17.040 --> 14:18.080
It’s not your fault.

14:20.360 --> 14:23.360
Have you got all the trusted aides of Baili Jinghong?

14:23.480 --> 14:24.280
Yes.

14:24.400 --> 14:25.680
After all, he was my former colleague.

14:26.520 --> 14:29.040
They'll disappear without blood.

14:29.400 --> 14:31.760
I'm afraid they don't know what's good for them.

14:32.920 --> 14:34.440
Let's go.

14:34.440 --> 14:35.720
Let's go to the front hall.

14:36.240 --> 14:37.840
You are in charge of the North Army.

14:37.840 --> 14:38.960
Why are you still listening to the order?

14:39.320 --> 14:41.440
We are not trying to rebel.

14:42.080 --> 14:43.880
but to help the Empress Dowager.

14:44.200 --> 14:46.280
to suppress the rebellion.

14:46.280 --> 14:47.760
Got it?

14:58.640 --> 15:01.160
Traitor! Traitor!

15:04.240 --> 15:05.040
Traitor!

15:05.720 --> 15:06.520
Traitor!

15:15.960 --> 15:16.800
Lord Huo.

15:17.640 --> 15:18.520
Decree.

16:16.560 --> 16:16.680
Jiaga.
